    "body": "The crash was not the distant smoke. The campsite teardown diagnostic called a prompt native on unverified registry handles. I removed that survey and kept the exact filtered teardown guard. The installed build then ran in Story for more than 13 minutes and over 76,000 script ticks with no ScriptHook exception. Please check the remaining campsite behavior: activation must persist with the correct Active and Inactive map names, Tear Down Camp must stay absent in all three views, Leave Fire must work, and the camp kit must stay out of the free-roam radial.",
